  "description": "Core 2.0 Commuter Electric Bike is expertly crafted for city commuting, delivering a smooth and comfortable riding experience. It features a wide, cushioned saddle and ergonomic handlebars to enhance comfort on every trip. Powered by a peak 1200W motor and a built-in 10.4Ah lithium battery, it offers an impressive range of up to 55 miles, so you can commute without concern for battery life. The bike is equipped with a 7-speed gear system, allowing versatile riding across various road conditions. For safety, it has a high-performance braking system, ensuring reliable stopping power. Overall, the Core 2.0 combines robust power, stability, comfort, and practicality, making it an excellent choice for urban commuters.",
